# Dependency and build output. These are not answer code and must never be committed. One side ran
# `go mod vendor` before sealing, which put third-party source into its sealed commit and tripped the
# size guard. Ignoring them here keeps them out of the sealed commit, out of the baseline, and out of
# the published delivery from one place.
/vendor/
/node_modules/
/__pycache__/
/.venv/
